# Large source texts are reproducible from govinfo and are not committed.
# Re-fetch with:
#   https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/PLAW-<congress>publ<num>/html/PLAW-<congress>publ<num>.htm
# The sliced, verbatim provisions actually used by the experiment ARE committed
# (provisions.json, provisions_extra.json), together with their SHA-256 prefixes
# in PREREGISTRATION.md, so the corpus stays auditable without the omnibus bulk.
bills/*.raw.htm
bills/CAA-2023-117publ328.txt
bills/CAA-2021-116publ260.txt

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
